# Citation metadata for PhyloRecViewer (Citation CFF 1.2.0).
#
# The archived releases and their immutable version DOIs:
#   * v0.1.0 — GitHub release 2026-09-29; Zenodo record deposited 2026-09-30,
#     version DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23053318;
#   * v0.1.2 — GitHub release 2026-10-26; Zenodo record deposited 2026-10-26,
#     version DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23653805.
# The concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23053317 resolves to the newest archived
# version (currently v0.1.2). There is no archived v0.1.1 release. The initial
# source commit a65c8f3 (the revision behind the first measurement tables) is
# preserved by the archive/initial-commit tag; the public v0.1.0 tag points to
# dd0d0b1.
#
# The repository working tree can be ahead of the archive: package.json is
# 0.2.0 (unreleased). This file describes the latest archived release so that
# a citation always resolves to a real DOI. When 0.2.0 is archived, update
# `version`, `date-released` and the DOI fields here together with the release.
cff-version: 1.2.0
